[English](README.en.md)

Hermes Agent（Nous Portal）上 OAuth 登录可以免费使用一些模型，包含 Hy3、Ox Alpha 等。本插件把它接到 dsh 上。

@jiesou/dsh-nous-portal-free-provider README · dsh-nous-portal-free-provider：Nous Portal free tier for dsh.

[简体中文](README.md)

OAuth sign-in on the Hermes Agent (Nous Portal) unlocks free access to a set of models, including Hy3, Ox Alpha, and more. This plugin wires that into dsh.
